WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the opportunity and its decision brief together while you review.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Inspect strengths, risks, missing information, and the time available before you commit.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Pursue, pass, or open the full record. Your decision stays connected to the opportunity.
